{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p style=\"text-align: left;\">香脆可口的炸豬扒向來是大人與小朋友的最愛。若想安坐家中親自下廚，怎樣才能炸出媲美餐廳水準的味道呢？肥媽曾在電視節目《食好D 食平D》中，分享了製作日式炸豬扒的實用食譜，只需簡單5個步驟，配合讓肉質變鬆軟的獨門小貼士，就能輕鬆做出外皮香脆、內裡多汁的滋味！</p><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"4d4f97c5-a93c-4e87-96f2-3eb7a7f01a12.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026WKwb1ispKQ1790763030.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"4d4f97c5-a93c-4e87-96f2-3eb7a7f01a12.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><div class=\"image-block responsive-block\" data-bs-component=\"generic\" style=\"margin: 0px 0px 4px; border-radius: 8px; overflow: hidden; background: rgb(255, 255, 255); border: 1px solid rgb(228, 231, 237);\">\n<div class=\"image-container\" style=\"position: relative; width: 100%; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px;\">\n<img alt=\"1dfa75fb-c192-45fe-94b8-36215013fbdf.jpg.webp\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/file/2026/09/2026Kgnzc2rn8h1790763029.webp?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\" style=\"width: 100%; max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 8px 8px 0px 0px; display: block; object-fit: contain;\" title=\"1dfa75fb-c192-45fe-94b8-36215013fbdf.jpg.webp\"/>\n</div>\n</div><p style=\"text-align: left;\"></p><p style=\"text-align: left;\">要炸出好吃的豬扒，肉質絕不能乾柴。肥媽特別指出兩個重要關鍵：</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li></li><li></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">準備食材</p><ul class=\"tiptap-bullet-list\"><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">西班牙黑毛豬豬扒</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">芝士</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">雞蛋</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">麵粉</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">麵包糠</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: left;\">調味料：鹽、蒜鹽、胡椒粉、水</p></li></ul><p style=\"text-align: left;\">日式炸豬扒製作步驟</p><ol class=\"tiptap-ordered-list\"><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li><li></li></ol></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-02T14:39:55.869551+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":210,"images":2,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none"}}